tionID":"QID1248","QuestionText":"For the next part of the survey, we will ask you to think about various tasks and what types of attributes are important for the completion of these tasks.<br>\n<br>\n<u><strong>Some tasks require the agents completing them to have attributes that are distinctively human<\/strong><\/u>. These might include being moral or spiritual, experiencing happiness, feeling love, having a personality, having a culture, having desires, having relationships with others, having a sense of humor, and\/or holding beliefs.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<u><strong>Some tasks require the agents completing them to have attributes that are shared between humans and artificial intelligence (AI).<\/strong><\/u> These might include communicating, detecting sounds, doing computations, implementing rules, making predictions about the future, recognizing faces, remembering things, sensing temperatures, using language, and\/or using logic.<br>\n<br>\n&nbsp;","QuestionText_Unsafe":"For the next part of the survey, we will ask you to think about various tasks that can be carried out either by a person or automated and be carried out by an AI algorithm.","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0enwwFyl7tk9fiS","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1249","SecondaryAttribute":"For each of the following tasks, please indicate whether it is more important for the agents comp...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"AnswerOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"Definitely have<strong> distinctively human attributes<\/strong><br \/>\n1"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"<br> 4"},"5":{"Display":"5"},"6":{"Display":"6"},"7":{"Display":"Definitely have<br><strong>&nbsp;attributes shared between humans and AI<\/strong><br \/>\n7"}},"ChoiceDataExportTags":{"1":"tasks_1","2":"tasks_2","3":"tasks_3","4":"tasks_4","5":"tasks_5","6":"