t\t\t<td>Holding beliefs<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>Communicating<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q40","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"For the next part of the survey, we will ask you to think about various tasks and what types of a...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1262"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0enwwFyl7tk9fiS","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1263","SecondaryAttribute":"For the next part of the survey, we will ask you to think about some specific types of attributes...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ChoiceOrder":[],"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":4,"QuestionDescription":"For the next part of the survey, we will ask you to think about some specific types of attributes...","QuestionText":"For the next part of the survey, we will ask you to think about some specific types of attributes that can be important for the completion of some tasks.<br>\n<br><b><u>Specifically, please think about the following attributes:<br><\/u><\/b>Communicating<br>Detecting sounds<br>Doing computations<br>Implementing rules<br>Making predictions about the future<br>Recognizing faces<br>Remembering things<br>Sensing temperatures<br>Using language<br>Using logic<br>\n<br><br>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"For the next part of the survey, we will ask you to think about various tasks and what types of attributes are important for the completion of these tasks.<br>\n<br>\n<u><strong>Some tasks require the agents who complete them to have attributes that are distinctively human<\/strong><\/u>. These might include being moral or spiritual, experiencing happiness, feeling love, having a personality, having a culture, having desires, haivng relationships with others, having a sense of humor, and\/or holding beliefs.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<u><strong>Some tasks require the agents who complete them to have attributes that are shared between humans and artificial intelligence (AI).<\/strong><\/u> These might include communicating, detecting sounds doing computations, implementing rules, making predictions about the future, recognizing faces, remembering things, sensing temperatures, using language, and\/or using logic.<br>\n<br><br>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"DataExportTag":"Q1263","QuestionID":"QID1263"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_0enwwFyl7tk9fiS","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1264","SecondaryAttribute":"For the next part of the survey, we will ask you to think about various tasks and what types of a...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"For the next part of the survey, we will ask you to think about various tasks and what types of attributes are important for the completion of these tasks. Please read through the following different types of attributes.&nbsp;<br><br>\n&nbsp;\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:500px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Distinctively Human Attributes<\/strong><\/td>\n\t\t\t<td><strong>Shared Attributes&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/strong><\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Being moral<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>Using logic<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Being spiritual<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>Using language<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Being happy<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>Sensing temperature<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Feeling love<\/td>\n\t\t\t<td>Remembering things<\/td>\n\t\t<\/tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<t